stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Absent: No checklist received
    Absent --> Empty: Refresh returns an empty checklist
    Absent --> Populated: Refresh returns requirements
    Absent --> Malformed: Response cannot be rendered
    Populated --> Malformed: Refresh returns malformed requirements
    Populated --> Unavailable: Requirements cannot be read
    Populated --> SourceChanged: Doctrine changes
    Malformed --> Recovered: Refresh returns valid requirements
    Unavailable --> Recovered: Refresh returns valid requirements
    SourceChanged --> Recovered: Reviewed doctrine returns valid requirements
    Recovered --> Empty: Refresh returns no requirements
    Empty --> Populated: Refresh returns requirements
    state Absent: Overview with no checklist
    state Empty: Overview with no checklist
    state Populated: Overview with recorded producer statuses
    state Malformed: Overview with checklist unavailable and Refresh deal
    state Unavailable: Overview with unreadable requirements and Refresh deal
    state SourceChanged: Overview with doctrine review message
    state Recovered: Overview with valid checklist and restored focus
    %% never Malformed evidence claims completion
    %% never Checklist failure closes Overview
